module party
edition 0
needs console and tasks


note: Two agents spread a party invite. The host writes it once; a messenger passes
    each guest's copy along a channel, and the greeter welcomes them as they arrive.
to messenger of guests (a list of text) into ch, needs tasks:
    for each guest in guests:
        send "{guest}, you are invited on Saturday at 7" into ch
    close ch


to greeter from ch giving an integer, needs console and tasks:
    let seen be 0, changeable
    for each invite received from ch:
        show invite
        set seen to seen plus 1
    give back seen


to main, needs console and tasks, may fail with several:
    let guests be ["Ada", "Grace", "Alan"]
    let ch be new-channel with capacity 1
    let sent be all of:
        messenger of guests into ch
        greeter from ch
    show "{item 2 of sent} invites delivered"
